  b42509b0cc55e6eb6b48953be946c09ac24cf6a3, with frunk.store's changes for this
  site in engine/rocks-web.patch (also tools/rocks/rocks-web.patch in
  https://github.com/RobertPKyle/frunk-store, whose tools/build-rocks.mjs builds
  it). The source the build came from, with the data that was shipped, is
  engine/rocksndiamonds-b42509b0cc55-web-src.tar.gz.

  The changes: compiled for the browser with upstream's own Emscripten Makefile
  target; no network play and no calls to the high score server (SDL_net is
  replaced by a stub, the server options removed); on-screen touch buttons
  switched on for touch screens; menus without the level editor, name entry and
  Quit; level and engine choices that needed other games removed; small hooks
  for this page; a faint fill on the touch buttons.

